OL,3,GNEWSATeddy bears help ease foster care
OL,4,Agoodbyes
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 11-year-old girl from Leicestershire
OL,7,Fhas created a teddy bear tradition to
OL,8,Fhelp her stay connected with foster
OL,9,Fchildren who become part of her family.
OL,11,FMillie, whose parents foster with
OL,12,FLeicestershire County Council, came up
OL,13,Fwith the idea to make saying goodbye a
OL,14,Flittle easier when children move on to
OL,15,Fthe next stage of their journey.
OL,17,FShe said she buys two identical teddies
OL,18,Fso she and the foster child can each
OL,19,Fhave one to cuddle while they are
OL,20,Fliving with her family.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,365,360,200,160,0,100
